      "title": "Introducing Grok Voice 3.0",
      "url": "https://x.ai/news/grok-voice-3",
      "published": "2026-10-14T00:00:00Z",
      "summary": "Today, we’re announcing Grok Voice 3.0, the world’s most intelligent speech-to-speech model. It sets a new record for resolving customer support calls, has class-leading latency at under one second, and costs less than other frontier models. Grok Voice powers millions of conversations a day across Tesla and SpaceX, and is available today in the API at the same price as its predecessor.",
